<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The inventory (uiinventory.py InventoryWindow, uiscript
	     inventorywindow.py; P14 spec 6.1). While the inventory flag is on,
	     the Interface makes nui_inventory.InventoryWindow (controller
	     assets/root/nui_inventory.py), a subclass of the legacy class whose
	     widgets are proxies: every flow, packet, question and rule is
	     legacy's code, and this document shows what legacy's refresh tells
	     the proxies. It exists only while the inventory shows
	     (nui_hud.OnDemand). The wear cells are the equipment group of the
	     wear table (nui_limits), placed by name (inv-wear--<name>) in each
	     skin's sheet, at the legacy places (EquipmentSlot) over the paper
	     doll: the figure (an image whose path the controller passes, by the
	     race), the lattice, the light and the rune circle under the feet,
	     all code but the figure; the costume, dragon soul and item shop
	     buttons stand in the equipment where legacy puts them. Under it the
	     stats row (attack, defence, magic attack, as the character window
	     counts them); the bag is a lean slot grid of INVENTORY_PAGE_SIZE
	     cells, one page at a time; the page tabs, the bag's columns and the
	     money's digits come from the limits module too. In the modern skins
	     a bag or wear item with a refine level shows it ("+6") where a count
	     would be none, and a refined wear item's cell is lit. The shortcut rail
	     (rail: the entries nui_inventory.register_shortcut adds, the
	     board's five once the game's interface binds the window; with none
	     there is no rail) docks on the window's left edge. Cell
	     events reach the legacy handlers through nui_slots.LegacySlotEvents
	     (pick and place through the legacy mouse controller). The body and
	     its controls take no focus, so controls act on a left mousedown. It
	     draws below the legacy UI layer (nui-below-legacy-ui), as legacy's
	     window lived in it, so the shop, exchange and safebox windows opened
	     over it cover it; the belt docks to inv-belt-dock. A left or right
	     press anywhere on it raises the window (board_press), as legacy's
	     window manager raised the window under a press. -->
	<title>inventory</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="inventory.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" id="inventory" class="nui-window nui-fx nui-anim nui-below-legacy-ui inv" data-model="inventory" data-event-mousedown="board_press(ev.button)"
      data-class-inv--table-new="table == 'new'" data-class-inv--table-old="table == 'old'"
      data-class-inv--placed="placed">
	<div class="nui-window__titlebar inv__titlebar">
		<handle id="inv-title" class="nui-window__handle inv__handle" move_target="#document">
			<span class="nui-window__title inv__title">@ui.INVENTORY_TITLE</span>
		</handle>
		<button id="inv-close" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-button--icon nui-window__close nui-anim inv__close"
		        data-event-mousedown="close_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--close"><span
			class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
	</div>
	<!-- The shortcut rail: one button per registered entry (rail), on the
	     window's left edge; empty, it is not drawn. An entry may carry a
	     badge (its count, "" for none) and be a feature still to come
	     (soon: its hint says so and it takes no press). The fold button
	     hides the entries (rail_folded) and shows them again. The kept
	     board's list is empty while it hides. -->
	<div class="nui-board nui-fx inv-rail" data-class-is-empty="size(rail) == 0" data-class-is-folded="rail_folded">
		<span class="inv-rail__grip"></span>
		<button class="nui-button nui-anim nui-has-tooltip inv-rail__button" data-for="e : rail"
		        data-attr-id="'inv-rail-' + e.id" data-attrif-disabled="!e.enabled" data-class-is-soon="e.soon"
		        data-event-mousedown="rail_press(e.id, ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph inv-rail__glyph"
			data-attr-class="'nui-glyph inv-rail__glyph nui-glyph--' + e.glyph"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
			class="nui-glyph__b"></span><span class="nui-glyph__c"></span></span><span
			class="nui-badge inv-rail__badge" data-if="e.badge != ''">{{ e.badge }}</span><span
			class="nui-tooltip nui-anim inv-tip inv-rail__tip">{{ e.tip }}<span class="inv-rail__soon"
			data-if="e.soon">@ui.NUI_RAIL_SOON</span></span></button>
		<span class="inv-rail__more"></span>
		<button id="inv-rail-fold" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-anim nui-has-tooltip inv-rail__fold"
		        data-event-mousedown="rail_fold(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph inv-rail__fold-glyph"
			data-attr-class="rail_folded ? 'nui-glyph inv-rail__fold-glyph nui-glyph--chevron-right' : 'nui-glyph inv-rail__fold-glyph nui-glyph--chevron-left'"><span
			class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span><span
			class="nui-tooltip nui-anim inv-tip inv-rail__tip inv-rail__tip--fold"><span data-if="!rail_folded">@ui.NUI_RAIL_FOLD</span><span
			data-if="rail_folded">@ui.NUI_RAIL_UNFOLD</span></span></button>
	</div>
	<div class="nui-window__body inv__body">
		<div id="inv-equip" class="inv-equip" data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right">
			<!-- The paper doll's art: the light, the rune circle, the figure
			     and the corner brackets; it goes with the wear places while the
			     kept board hides (wear_on), so its rune stops turning. -->
			<div class="inv-doll" data-for="g : wear_on">
				<div class="inv-doll__light"></div>
				<div class="inv-doll__rune"><div class="inv-doll__spin nui-anim"><span
					class="inv-doll__ring inv-doll__ring--outer"></span><span class="inv-doll__ring inv-doll__ring--glow"></span><span
					class="inv-doll__ring inv-doll__ring--inner"></span><span class="inv-doll__tick inv-doll__tick--a"></span><span
					class="inv-doll__tick inv-doll__tick--b"></span><span class="inv-doll__tick inv-doll__tick--c"></span><span
					class="inv-doll__tick inv-doll__tick--d"></span><span class="inv-doll__chord inv-doll__chord--a"></span><span
					class="inv-doll__chord inv-doll__chord--b"></span><span class="inv-doll__chord inv-doll__chord--c"></span><span
					class="inv-doll__chord inv-doll__chord--d"></span><span class="inv-doll__chord inv-doll__chord--e"></span><span
					class="inv-doll__chord inv-doll__chord--f"></span></div></div>
				<img class="inv-doll__figure" data-if="figure != ''" data-attr-src="figure"/>
				<span class="inv-doll__corner inv-doll__corner--tl"></span><span class="inv-doll__corner inv-doll__corner--tr"></span><span
					class="inv-doll__corner inv-doll__corner--bl"></span><span class="inv-doll__corner inv-doll__corner--br"></span>
			</div>
			<!-- V-2: the wear places go while the kept board hides (wear_on is [] then). -->
			<div class="inv-wear-places" data-for="g : wear_on">
				<div class="inv-wear-place" data-for="w : wear" data-attr-class="'inv-wear-place inv-wear--' + w.name">
					<div class="nui-slot nui-anim nui-fx inv-wear" data-attr-id="'inv-wear-' + w.name"
					     data-class-is-empty="w.kind == ''" data-class-is-target="w.target == 'move'"
					     data-class-is-blocked="w.target == 'blocked'"
					     data-class-is-refined="w.count == '' &amp;&amp; w.refine > 0" data-class-inv-wear--refined="w.refine > 0"
					     data-event-mousedown="wear_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseup="wear_release(it_index, ev.button)"
					     data-event-dblclick="wear_use(it_index)" data-event-mouseover="wear_over(it_index)"
					     data-event-mouseout="wear_out(it_index)" data-event-nuidrop="wear_drop(it_index)">
						<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="w.icon != ''" data-attr-src="w.icon"/>
						<nui-number class="nui-slot__number" data-if="w.count != '' || w.refine > 0"
							data-attr-value="w.count != '' ? w.count : '+' + w.refine"/>
						<!-- An empty unique, arrow or belt place's mark (w.marks: none, or
						     its glyph's name; classic hides glyphs). -->
						<span data-for="m : w.marks" data-attr-class="'nui-glyph inv-wear__mark nui-glyph--' + m"><span
							class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span><span class="nui-glyph__c"></span></span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<!-- The costume, dragon soul and item shop buttons, where legacy's
			     equipment base holds them. -->
			<button id="inv-costume" class="nui-button nui-anim nui-has-tooltip inv-button inv-button--costume"
			        data-if="has_costume" data-event-mousedown="costume_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--character"><span
				class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span><span class="nui-tooltip nui-anim inv-tip">@ui.COSTUME_TITLE</span></button>
			<button id="inv-dss" class="nui-button nui-anim nui-has-tooltip inv-button inv-button--dss"
			        data-if="has_dss" data-class-is-on="dss_active" data-event-mousedown="dss_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--gem"><span
				class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span><nui-frames class="inv-button__effect" data-if="dss_active"
				count="13" delay="0.0667"/><span class="nui-tooltip nui-anim inv-tip">@ui.TASKBAR_DRAGON_SOUL</span></button>
			<button id="inv-mall" class="nui-button nui-anim nui-has-tooltip inv-button inv-button--mall"
			        data-if="has_mall" data-event-mousedown="mall_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--shop"><span
				class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span><span class="nui-tooltip nui-anim inv-tip">@ui.MALL_TITLE</span></button>
			<div id="inv-belt-dock" class="inv-belt-dock"></div>
		</div>
		<!-- Attack, defence and magic attack (the character window's sums). -->
		<div class="inv-stats">
			<span class="inv-stat"><span class="inv-stat__icon inv-stat__icon--attack"><span class="inv-stat__a"></span><span
				class="inv-stat__b"></span></span><span class="inv-stat__value">{{ stat_attack }}</span></span>
			<span class="inv-stat"><span class="inv-stat__icon inv-stat__icon--defence"><span class="inv-stat__a"></span><span
				class="inv-stat__b"></span></span><span class="inv-stat__value">{{ stat_defence }}</span></span>
			<span class="inv-stat"><span class="inv-stat__icon inv-stat__icon--magic"><span class="inv-stat__a"></span><span
				class="inv-stat__b"></span></span><span class="inv-stat__value">{{ stat_magic }}</span></span>
		</div>
		<div id="inv-tabs" class="inv-tabs" data-for="g : tabs_on">
			<button class="nui-button nui-anim nui-has-tooltip inv-tab" data-for="p : pages" data-attr-id="'inv-tab-' + it_index"
			        data-class-is-selected="it_index == page" data-event-mousedown="page_press(it_index, ev.button)"><span
				class="inv-tab__label">{{ p.label }}</span><span class="nui-tooltip nui-anim inv-tip">{{ p.hint }}</span></button>
		</div>
		<div id="inv-bag" class="nui-slot-grid nui-slot-grid--lean inv-bag" data-for="g : bag_on"
		     data-class-is-attaching="bag_attaching"
		     data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right"
		     data-class-nui-slot-grid--cols-5="bag_cols == 5" data-class-nui-slot-grid--cols-4="bag_cols == 4">
			<div class="nui-slot nui-anim nui-fx" data-for="c : bag" data-attr-id="'inv-bag-' + it_index"
			     data-class-is-empty="c.kind == '' &amp;&amp; !c.covered" data-class-is-covered="c.covered"
			     data-class-is-picked="c.picked" data-class-is-active="c.active"
			     data-class-is-target="c.target == 'move'" data-class-is-blocked="c.target == 'blocked'"
			     data-class-is-usable="c.target == 'usable'" data-class-is-unusable="c.target == 'unusable'"
			     data-class-nui-slot--h2="c.h == 2" data-class-nui-slot--h3="c.h == 3"
			     data-class-is-refined="c.count == '' &amp;&amp; c.refine > 0"
			     data-event-mousedown="bag_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseup="bag_release(it_index, ev.button)"
			     data-event-dblclick="bag_use(it_index)" data-event-mouseover="bag_over(it_index)"
			     data-event-mouseout="bag_out(it_index)" data-event-nuidrop="bag_drop(it_index)">
				<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="c.icon != ''" data-attr-src="c.icon"/>
				<!-- The count, or for an item without one its refine level ("+6",
				     is-refined; no extra element per cell). -->
				<nui-number class="nui-slot__number" data-if="c.count != '' || c.refine > 0"
					data-attr-value="c.count != '' ? c.count : '+' + c.refine"/>
				<nui-frames class="nui-slot__active" data-if="c.active" count="13" delay="0.0667"/>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div id="inv-money" class="inv-money" data-event-mousedown="money_press(ev.button)">
			<span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--coin inv-money__coin"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span>
			<span class="inv-money__amount">{{ money }}</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
